== Effects ==
* Upon use, Isaac farts, [[charm]]ing all nearby enemies.
** {{dlc|nr}} The cloud deals 5 damage.

== Synergies ==
* {{i|Bird's Eye}}/{{i|Ghost Pepper}}: Whenever the player creates a charming fart, a fire will be shot in a random direction.
* {{Book of Virtues synergy|description=Spawns purple wisps on the middle ring. The wisps [[charm]] nearby enemies when destroyed.}}
* {{t|Second Hand}}: Doubles charm duration.

== Interactions ==
* {{i|Car Battery}}: Spawns two charming farts on top of each other {{dlc|nr}} and the cloud deals double damage.

